[
  {
    "title": "Expressions & Strings",
    "tag": "LESSON 09",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "Chapter 3 · Algorithms & Programming",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Expressions<br>&amp; Strings</h1><p class=\"zh\">表达式 · 运算优先级 · 字符串</p><p class=\"small\">Build and test a Workshop Pass · 90 minutes</p>",
    "note": "从前两章回到亲手编程，用已有赋值和顺序执行组合算术、取余与字符串。最终产出是能运行并有测试记录的Workshop Pass，不是正式Create作品。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve assignment and arithmetic",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL",
    "time": "2–6 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.B · AAP-2.C",
    "html": "<pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.3\">a ← 5\nb ← a\na ← 8</pre><ol><li>What value does b hold now?</li><li>Evaluate 2 + 3 * 4.</li><li>Does DISPLAY(a) change a?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>5; 14; no.</strong> Copy the earlier value, multiply before adding, and distinguish display from assignment.</div></details>",
    "note": "独立90秒再同桌解释。复制题若答8，指出只有赋值左侧目标更新，不扩展引用语义。算术题检查是否记得乘加顺序，显示题检查状态改变。"
  },
  {
    "title": "What you will build and explain",
    "tag": "LEARNING GOALS",
    "time": "6–8 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.B/C/D",
    "html": "<ol><li>Evaluate expressions in the correct order.</li><li>Distinguish division from MOD.</li><li>Join strings and extract a defined substring.</li><li>Build, trace and test a short program.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Expressions produce values; assignment stores a result.</p>",
    "note": "求值和赋值不同：表达式可以直接用于DISPLAY。字符串过程要先读本课定义，不假定各语言或考试题都用相同名称和下标。"
  },
  {
    "title": "An expression produces one value",
    "tag": "EXPRESSIONS",
    "time": "8–12 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.B.3–5",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Values, variables, operators and calls can form an expression.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A current variable is read, an expression is evaluated and its result is assigned.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 160\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Current value</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">tickets: 3</text><path d=\"M380.6666666666667 80.0H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 73.0L413.6666666666667 80.0L399.6666666666667 87.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Expression</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">tickets * 12</text><path d=\"M787.3333333333334 80.0H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 73.0L820.3333333333334 80.0L806.3333333333334 87.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Store the result</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">total ← result</text></svg></figure><p>What value does this expression produce?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>36.</strong> Read tickets as 3, evaluate the product, then store it in total.</div></details>",
    "note": "沿图从已有值走到表达式，再到存储目标。图不显示最终36，先预测再揭晓。变量名和变量当时保存的值必须区分。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Parentheses change the route",
    "tag": "ORDER OF OPERATIONS",
    "time": "12–16 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.C.4",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Compare 7 + 3 * 2 with (7 + 3) * 2.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two expression routes differ in their first operation.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 160\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Without parentheses</text><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">3 * 2, then add 7</text><path d=\"M584.0 80.0H605.0\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M603.0 73.0L617.0 80.0L603.0 87.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"625.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">With parentheses</text><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">7 + 3, then multiply</text></svg></figure><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>13</strong> and <strong>20</strong>, respectively.</div></details><p class=\"small\">* / MOD share precedence; evaluate equal-precedence operations left to right.</p>",
    "note": "图只给求值路线，不提前给结果。左到右适用于当前同级运算，不能越过乘法先做加法。用括号表达真实意图，不设计不必要的歧义长式。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Division can produce a decimal",
    "tag": "DIVISION",
    "time": "16–20 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.C.3",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">/ is not automatically integer division in AP pseudocode.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Eight units are shared equally among five recipients.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 160\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Amount</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">8 units</text><path d=\"M380.6666666666667 80.0H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 73.0L413.6666666666667 80.0L399.6666666666667 87.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Equal shares</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">5 shares</text><path d=\"M787.3333333333334 80.0H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 73.0L820.3333333333334 80.0L806.3333333333334 87.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Per share</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">8 / 5 = ?</text></svg></figure><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>1.6 units per share.</strong> Integer operands do not force an integer result.</div></details><p class=\"small\">Keep units: minutes / 60 gives hours.</p>",
    "note": "对齐官方参考表而非某些语言的整除习惯。8/5不是1，也不是余3。除零不属于本课正常输入，单位帮助区分时长和余数。"
  },
  {
    "title": "MOD keeps the remainder",
    "tag": "MODULUS",
    "time": "20–24 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.C.1–2",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Pack 17 items into groups of 5. Find 17 MOD 5.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Seventeen markers are arranged into complete groups of five and an unfinished group. Count the leftover markers.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 165\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"25\" width=\"265\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"55\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><circle cx=\"99\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><circle cx=\"143\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><circle cx=\"187\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><circle cx=\"231\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"315\" y=\"25\" width=\"265\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"355\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><circle cx=\"399\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><circle cx=\"443\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><circle cx=\"487\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><circle cx=\"531\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"615\" y=\"25\" width=\"265\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"655\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><circle cx=\"699\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><circle cx=\"743\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><circle cx=\"787\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><circle cx=\"831\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"915\" y=\"25\" width=\"265\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"955\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#d3ad62\"/><circle cx=\"999\" cy=\"87\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#d3ad62\"/></svg></figure><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>2.</strong> 17 = 3 × 5 + 2.</div></details><p class=\"small\">a MOD b assumes integer a ≥ 0 and integer b &gt; 0.</p>",
    "note": "让学生从分组图数余下物品再揭晓。MOD返回余数，不是商或百分比。保留非负整数被除数和正整数除数前提，不讨论负操作数的语言差异。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A remainder has a useful boundary",
    "tag": "REMAINDER CHECK",
    "time": "24–28 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.C.2/4",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">For a MOD 6, the remainder is an integer from 0 through 5.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A number line shows allowed remainder values zero through five for a divisor of six.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 150\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><path d=\"M100 75H1100\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"75\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">0</text><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"75\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">1</text><circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"75\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"500\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">2</text><circle cx=\"700\" cy=\"75\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"700\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">3</text><circle cx=\"900\" cy=\"75\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"900\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">4</text><circle cx=\"1100\" cy=\"75\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"1100\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">5</text></svg></figure><p>Evaluate 18 MOD 6 and 20 MOD 6.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>0</strong> and <strong>2</strong>. A multiple of the divisor has no remainder.</div></details>",
    "note": "用0≤余数&lt;除数核查结果。若答6，说明还可以组成一整组。两例覆盖整除与非整除，之后程序测试也应包括这两种。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A string is a sequence of characters",
    "tag": "STRINGS",
    "time": "28–32 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.A.3–4 · AAP-2.D",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Quotes distinguish a string literal from a numeric literal.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Quoted12 is a string; unquoted12 is a numeric literal.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 160\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">String literal</text><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">&quot;12&quot;</text><path d=\"M584.0 80.0H605.0\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M603.0 73.0L617.0 80.0L603.0 87.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"625.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Numeric literal</text><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">12</text></svg></figure><p>Spaces are characters: \"A B\" differs from \"AB\".</p><details><summary>Show a useful distinction</summary><div class=\"answer\">Use numbers for arithmetic; strings can preserve characters in identifiers such as \"007\".</div></details>",
    "note": "只用英文字母、数字、空格，暂避Unicode字符与编码单元区别。引号通常是代码定界符，不属于值的内容。文字\"12\"不能未经规定转换就作为数字参与运算。"
  },
  {
    "title": "CONCAT joins exactly what you supply",
    "tag": "TEACHING PROCEDURE",
    "time": "32–36 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.D.1",
    "html": "<p class=\"small\"><strong>Defined here:</strong> CONCAT(a, b) returns two strings joined in order. It adds no spaces.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two supplied string arguments are joined; the result is left for prediction.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 160\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">First string</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">&quot;Hello, &quot;</text><path d=\"M380.6666666666667 80.0H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 73.0L413.6666666666667 80.0L399.6666666666667 87.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Second string</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">&quot;Ada&quot;</text><path d=\"M787.3333333333334 80.0H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 73.0L820.3333333333334 80.0L806.3333333333334 87.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Joined string</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">?</text></svg></figure><p>Evaluate CONCAT(\"Hello, \", \"Ada\").</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>\"Hello, Ada\".</strong> The space comes from the first argument.</div></details><p class=\"small\">CONCAT is supplied for this lesson, not a fixed AP-reference built-in.</p>",
    "note": "先读定义再求值。参数没有空格就不会自动插入。调用返回新字符串，不自动修改原值。过程名称是本课约定，不是官方固定内建项。"
  },
  {
    "title": "SUBSTRING uses a start and a length",
    "tag": "TEACHING PROCEDURE",
    "time": "36–40 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.D.2",
    "html": "<p class=\"small\"><strong>Defined here:</strong> SUBSTRING(s, start, length) returns length consecutive characters from position start. Positions begin at <strong>1</strong>.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"PLANET has positions1 through6. Find three characters beginning at position2.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 150\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"95\" y=\"45\" width=\"135\" height=\"85\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"162\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><text x=\"162\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"41\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">P</text><rect x=\"265\" y=\"45\" width=\"135\" height=\"85\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"332\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><text x=\"332\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"41\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">L</text><rect x=\"435\" y=\"45\" width=\"135\" height=\"85\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"502\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><text x=\"502\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"41\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><rect x=\"605\" y=\"45\" width=\"135\" height=\"85\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"672\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">4</text><text x=\"672\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"41\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">N</text><rect x=\"775\" y=\"45\" width=\"135\" height=\"85\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"842\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">5</text><text x=\"842\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"41\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">E</text><rect x=\"945\" y=\"45\" width=\"135\" height=\"85\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1012\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">6</text><text x=\"1012\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"41\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p>Evaluate SUBSTRING(\"PLANET\", 2, 3).</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>\"LAN\".</strong> Positions 2, 3 and 4.</div></details><p class=\"small\">The third argument is a count, not an ending position. Examples stay within the string.</p>",
    "note": "先定位第二字符再数三个。图只给索引，没有高亮答案。所有例子采用正长度且不越界；任何题目若另给定义，服从其定义。该名称不是官方固定表的字符串内建函数。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Build a substring, then join",
    "tag": "COMPOSE EXPRESSIONS",
    "time": "40–44 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.D.1–2",
    "html": "<p class=\"small\">Use the supplied CONCAT and 1-based SUBSTRING definitions.</p><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.3\">word ← &quot;COMPUTE&quot;\npart ← SUBSTRING(word, 1, 3)\nlabel ← CONCAT(part, &quot;-lab&quot;)\nDISPLAY(label)</pre><p>Predict part, label and the unchanged word.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>\"COM\"; \"COM-lab\"; \"COMPUTE\".</strong> Only assignment targets are updated.</div></details>",
    "note": "逐行记录被赋值变量。子串调用不会从word删除字符，CONCAT也不会改动part。先写状态表再揭晓，减少凭单行表面猜最终输出。"
  },
  {
    "title": "An assignment does not create a live formula",
    "tag": "COPY & UPDATE",
    "time": "44–48 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.B · AAP-2.B.6",
    "html": "<pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.3\">minutes ← 90\nhours ← minutes / 60\nminutes ← 120</pre><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"An earlier hours calculation precedes the later assignment to minutes; hours is not assigned again.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 160\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Earlier</text><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">hours ← minutes / 60</text><path d=\"M584.0 80.0H605.0\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M603.0 73.0L617.0 80.0L603.0 87.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"625.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"136\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Later</text><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">minutes ← 120</text></svg></figure><p>Does hours now hold 2?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>No: hours remains 1.5.</strong> Re-execute the calculation to update it.</div></details>",
    "note": "表达式执行一次得到数值，赋给hours后不会自动跟踪minutes。不要把电子表格的公式重算经验套到普通赋值。图中保留结果未知以便预测。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Set up the Workshop Pass",
    "tag": "LAB SETUP",
    "time": "48–51 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.B/C/D",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\"><a href=\"Chapter_3_Programming_Lab.html#expressions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Chapter 3 Programming Lab → Expressions</a></p><p>Input queue: one JSON scalar per line.</p><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.3\">&quot;Ada&quot;\n105</pre><p class=\"small\">First: name, at least 2 English letters. Second: integer minutes, 0–180. Assume valid inputs; no IF validation yet.</p>",
    "note": "输入队列与代码区分开：名字必须加双引号，分钟不加；不输入列表。检查顺序与有效前提，本课不加入还未学的条件验证。"
  },
  {
    "title": "1 · Plan the outputs",
    "tag": "WORKSHOP PASS · 5 MINUTES",
    "time": "51–56 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.A/B",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Help a participant read their name and session duration.</p><ol><li>Read name, then minutes.</li><li>Display \"Hello, \" joined with the name.</li><li>Display the first two name characters as a badge code.</li><li>Display minutes / 60 and minutes MOD 60 with labels.</li></ol><details><summary>Show planning support</summary><div class=\"answer\">Use CONCAT(\"Hello, \", name), SUBSTRING(name, 1, 2), and separate / and MOD expressions.</div></details>",
    "note": "先画路线、写变量再编辑。十进制小时和整小时之外余下分钟是不同量，要标清。两字符代码可能重复，不能称为唯一ID。"
  },
  {
    "title": "2 · Write your sequential program",
    "tag": "WORKSHOP PASS · 9 MINUTES",
    "time": "56–65 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.B/C/D",
    "html": "<p>Use meaningful names and one statement per line.</p><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.3\">name ← INPUT()\nminutes ← INPUT()</pre><p>Complete your plan. Put labels and numeric values in separate DISPLAY calls.</p><details><summary>Show optional starter fragments</summary><div class=\"answer\"><span class=\"mono\">greeting ← CONCAT(\"Hello, \", name)<br>DISPLAY(greeting)<br>DISPLAY(minutes / 60)</span></div></details>",
    "note": "保留9分钟真实编写。CONCAT只接收字符串，不靠隐式数值转换；输出标签单独DISPLAY。片段不是完整解答，仍需完成badge、MOD和标签。巡视询问每行读写哪些值。"
  },
  {
    "title": "3 · Test different valid inputs",
    "tag": "WORKSHOP PASS · 6 MINUTES",
    "time": "65–71 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.J · AAP-2.C/D",
    "html": "<p>Compute expected values before running.</p><table><tr><th>Name</th><th>Minutes</th><th>Purpose</th></tr><tr><td>\"Ada\"</td><td>105</td><td>Nonzero remainder</td></tr><tr><td>\"Li\"</td><td>0</td><td>Valid lower boundary</td></tr><tr><td>\"Maya\"</td><td>180</td><td>Whole hours</td></tr></table><details><summary>Show expected values</summary><div class=\"answer\">Ada: <strong>\"Hello, Ada\", \"Ad\", 1.75, 45</strong>.<br>Li: <strong>\"Hello, Li\", \"Li\", 0, 0</strong>.<br>Maya: <strong>\"Hello, Maya\", \"Ma\", 3, 0</strong>.</div></details>",
    "note": "输入必须逐例重置队列；标签可不同但四项值要对应。大小写保留，Ad不是AD。105能揭露把除法错误截断的实现，只测180不能发现。"
  },
  {
    "title": "4 · Revise and explain one change",
    "tag": "WORKSHOP PASS · 5 MINUTES",
    "time": "71–76 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.E/J · AAP-2.B.7",
    "html": "<ol><li>Let a partner read the outputs.</li><li>Correct an unclear label or failed test.</li><li>Run all three cases again.</li><li>Save code, expected/actual values and one explanation.</li></ol><details><summary>Show a revision note</summary><div class=\"answer\">Example: “I changed the start from 0 to 1 because our SUBSTRING definition uses 1-based positions.”</div></details>",
    "note": "反馈需具体可操作。代码已正确也可改善命名，但解释它怎样帮助理解。不要加入额外功能挤占复测；每人保留自己的修改记录。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Diagnose the indexing mistake",
    "tag": "DEBUG",
    "time": "76–79 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.D.2",
    "html": "<p>Our supplied SUBSTRING uses positions beginning at 1.</p><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.3\">tag ← SUBSTRING(&quot;ROBOT&quot;, 0, 2)</pre><p>A learner wants the first two characters. What must change?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Use <span class=\"mono\">SUBSTRING(\"ROBOT\", 1, 2)</span>, giving <strong>\"RO\"</strong>.</div></details>",
    "note": "这是本课过程定义下的无效起点，不是所有语言普遍规律。修start即可，length仍为2。再次要求学生依据约定而非背函数名字。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Evaluate one expression carefully",
    "tag": "ORIGINAL AP-STYLE",
    "time": "79–82 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.C.4",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Evaluate 2 + 17 MOD 5.</p><div class=\"options\"><p>A. 4</p><p>B. 3.8</p><p>C. 14</p><p>D. 19</p></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>A: 4.</strong> MOD first produces 2; then add 2.</div></details>",
    "note": "先写求值顺序。不能推广为MOD永远最先，有括号需先处理。题目是原创AP风格练习，不是官方样题。"
  },
