    "title": "Choose exactly two valid statements",
    "tag": "ORIGINAL AP-STYLE",
    "time": "82–85 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.C/D",
    "html": "<p>Using our supplied string procedures, which TWO are true?</p><div class=\"options\"><p>A. CONCAT(\"A\", \"B\") inserts a space.</p><p>B. 11 / 4 gives 2.75.</p><p>C. 11 MOD 4 gives 3.</p><p>D. SUBSTRING(\"CODE\", 2, 2) gives \"CO\".</p></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>B and C.</strong> A gives \"AB\"; D gives \"OD\".</div></details>",
    "note": "逐项判断后恰选两项。除法和取余分别检查，子串使用给定1-based和长度语义。干扰项解释可让学生口述，不仅报字母。"
